# KeyNest Web Client Configuration

# URL pointing to the running KeyNest Backend REST API
# For local development with start.bat, default is http://localhost:4000/api/v1
# In Vercel production deployment, set this to your hosted backend URL (e.g. https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1)
VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:4000/api/v1"
